<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Halla Group wins $212 mln Philippine order.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Halla Group wins $212 mln Philippine order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Halla Group said on Tuesday it had won a $212 million order to build a cement plant in the Philippines on a turn-key basis.  </p>
<p>The group said the plant with an annual capacity of 1.6 million tonnes would be built by the end of 1999.</p>
<p>South Western Cement Corp of the Philippines placed the order, Halla said.</p>
